---
config:
  theme: forest
---
stateDiagram-v2
    classDef alert fill:#f96,stroke:#a33,stroke-width:2px
    classDef calm fill:#cfe,color:#063
    state "Waiting for a card" as Waiting
    Waiting : the screen shows the welcome text
    [*] --> Waiting
    Waiting --> Reading : card inserted
    Reading --> Reading : retry
    Reading --> Menu : PIN accepted
    Reading --> Blocked:::alert : three wrong PINs
    Menu --> Waiting : card taken
    class Menu calm
    style Waiting stroke-dasharray:4 2
    note right of Reading : the PIN is checked<br>by the bank
    note left of Blocked
        the card is kept
        and the bank is told
    end note
    Blocked --> [*]
